CHECK:UNNECESSARY_PARENTHESES: Unnecessary parentheses around 'priv->ieee80211->queue_stop'
#148: FILE: drivers/staging/rtl8192su/r8192S_firmware.c:90:
+		if (!priv->ieee80211->check_nic_enough_desc(dev, tcb_desc->queue_index) ||
+			(!skb_queue_empty(&priv->ieee80211->skb_waitQ[tcb_desc->queue_index])) ||
+			(priv->ieee80211->queue_stop)) {

Parentheses are not required in the following cases:

  1. Function pointer uses::

      (foo->bar)();

    could be::

      foo->bar();

  2. Comparisons in if::

      if ((foo->bar) && (foo->baz))
      if ((foo == bar))

    could be::

      if (foo->bar && foo->baz)
      if (foo == bar)

  3. addressof/dereference single Lvalues::

      &(foo->bar)
      *(foo->bar)

    could be::

      &foo->bar
      *foo->bar

